  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="work" n="126">
        <pb n="165"/>
        <head>126 — iv — VIII. — <quote>Turn, Lord, and deliver my soul</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">The tree <pb n="166"/> of my soul that is [devoid of<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> fruits has grown fat<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/> and thick and broad from<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/> the weight of fleshly lusts and pleasures; and I see that already the ax<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> of threatening is laid to the root : but may thy words, O! Forerunner of <persName>our Saviour</persName> and Baptist, run before, and produce in me good fruits meet for<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/> repentance, and may they hinder and prevent the stroke<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a7" target="#n7" n="7"/> because of the mercifulness of him who willeth the life and conversion of sinners, <persName>Christ</persName> our God.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 165, n. 15</orig></choice> Ps. vi, 5.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 166, n. 1</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>without</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 166, n. 2</orig></choice> Deut. xxxii, 15 LXX <quote>And <persName>Jacob</persName> ate and was sated and the beloved kicked. And he grew fat and thick, and he grew broad and left the Lord who made him; he withdrew from God his Saviour.</quote></note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 166, n. 3</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>by</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 166, n. 4</orig></choice> Matth. iii, 10 <quote>Lo! the ax..... fire.</quote></note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 166, n. 5</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>of</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n7" target="#a7" n="7"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 166, n. 6</orig></choice> Luke xiii, 6-9 <quote>A certain man..... if not, next year thou shalt cut it down.</quote></note>
      </noteGrp>
    </body>
